    "text": "golaurens.com\nwebsite\nLaurens\nLaurens City Council approves resolutions aimed at public safety\nBy MELISSA GIBSON,\n7 hours agoThe Laurens City Council meeting this week brought two unanimous votes toward improvements in safety and quality of life for the city. The first resolution approved the request to South Carolina Department of Transportation (SCDOT) to install enhanced truck bypass signage, pavement markings and traffic control devices to enforce the city code as well as assistance with digital mapping to reflect updates for designated truck routes.\n3",
